@NetPulseCore_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Overview Summary
GET {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/overview
Accept: application/json

### Health Check
GET {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/health
Accept: application/json

### Live Telemetry
GET {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/telemetry/live
Accept: application/json

### List Nodes
GET {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes
Accept: application/json

### Register New Node
POST {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/nodes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nodeName": "node-frankfurt-gpu-01",
  "region": "eu-central-1",
  "workloadType": "AI-Worker",
  "cpuCores": 32,
  "totalMemoryMb": 65536
}

### Enqueue Background Job
POST {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Global Telemetry Compaction",
  "jobType": "TelemetryAudit",
  "estimatedDurationSec": 4
}

### List Jobs
GET {{NetPulseCore_HostAddress}}/api/v1/jobs
Accept: application/json
